---
description: Use Graphify for repository structure and code-flow questions
globs:
alwaysApply: true
---

When `graphify-out/graph.json` exists:

- Run `graphify query "<question>"` for broad repository questions.
- Run `graphify path "<source>" "<target>"` to trace a relationship.
- Run `graphify explain "<node>"` to inspect one graph node.
- Do not load the complete `graph.json` or `graph.html` into model context.
- Verify mutable facts in current source.

Run Graphify through the terminal. Ignore files do not block direct terminal access.
